[p]We wanted to share a quick thought: “Demon Hunters” has started to look very different from its early version.[/p][p]Our 2D sprites are now based on 3D graphics — this gives more depth, soft lighting and richer details. Characters look more expressive and the environments more atmospheric.[/p][p]On these screenshots you can see how everything became more vivid:
– Shadows and light add depth;
– Animations and effects bring more dynamics;
– The interface is simpler and clearer.[/p][p]In addition, we have worked on and reworked the sounds and music, there is still a lot of work and there are some flaws that we know about, but the progress is obvious.[/p][p]We’re happy to see “Demon Hunters” shaping its own style and mood.[/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45256073/1f7c3a237c9819ded40e7b424c4895dae05b6559.jpg"][/img][/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45256073/3707c8a70cbde650d6489fd4a6183a5c862811ba.png"][/img][/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45256073/2c02119e0d7fe9059f7b6d5b6382e9a07141a4bc.png"][/img][/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45256073/054d6bdf2ae59ba90d1b5d127e951b7750b59512.png"][/img][/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45256073/361e73233feae2ed50f7c7af2fcc238e890bf49b.png"][/img][/p][p][img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45256073/a2d991788448b35693fc01b9a03a656fd2fe565f.png"][/img][/p][p][/p][p][/p]
